Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}本字幕來源互聯網  原製作者： HSQ-Rip
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}感謝字幕組及製作字幕個人的辛勤勞動與付出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:15.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}字幕時間軸由kewenyu調整以適應當前作品
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.60,0:00:07.90,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,0)\fs42\pos(660,1012)}奧布聯合酋長國     初島海岸
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.84,0:00:44.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別慌 登船時請保持秩序
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.52,0:00:47.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,船上有足夠空間收容所有人員
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.62,0:00:56.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,父親
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.63,0:00:57.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,親愛的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.82,0:01:00.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事 目標是軍事設施
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.10,0:01:01.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,趕緊！真
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.56,0:01:39.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,瑪尤 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.23,0:01:44.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,瑪尤的手機...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.61,0:01:47.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別管那些了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.90,0:01:48.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.88,0:02:08.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,趕快救治傷患 給避難中心發信號
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.73,0:02:13.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.81,0:02:17.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,往這邊 快
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.46,0:02:21.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸呢 媽媽呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.56,0:02:24.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,瑪尤呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.21,0:02:36.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,瑪尤！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.32,0:02:37.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.46,0:05:23.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,C.E.72 地球·Plant之間歷時一年半的戰爭
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.20,0:05:28.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,終於在雅金·多維宇域的戰鬥中迎來了終結
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.24,0:05:31.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,經過雙方同意
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.55,0:05:36.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在過去的悲劇發生地尤尼烏斯七號上締結的條約
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.19,0:05:39.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,成為雙方今後相互理解努力追求和平的誓言
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.79,0:05:44.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,世界再次開始走向安定...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.91,0:05:48.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,勞俄雷010 非鎖定系統接通
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.91,0:05:50.82,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,600)\fs42\pos(1406,952)}L4·Plant  軍火庫一號
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.22,0:05:52.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這裏是勞俄雷010 確認衛星網路系統鏈結
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.17,0:05:55.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,010入港向量良好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.92,0:05:59.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,繼續減速 三號甲板採取B狀態待機
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.94,0:06:04.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,14:00在第三直升機場進行軍樂隊最終彩排
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.54,0:06:06.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不對不對
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.86,0:06:09.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,吉恩全部換典禮裝備
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.55,0:06:11.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,去三號機庫換裝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.71,0:06:14.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,快讓那些卡茲朵開走
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.87,0:06:17.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,來福槍的維護別耽擱了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.36,0:06:18.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,等明天就晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.38,0:06:23.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,第二維修班到請第六機庫集合
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.06,0:06:30.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,已經亂成一團了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.42,0:06:35.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒辦法 好久沒舉辦過 加上新手多
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.21,0:06:36.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就像我們
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.14,0:06:41.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過這次密涅瓦總算可以出擊了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.62,0:06:44.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真的像傳說那樣被安排在月球軌道？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.01,0:07:05.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他的意思我也明白
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.18,0:07:09.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但藍波斯菊與其說是組織不如說是主義者
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.43,0:07:16.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,再怎麼補充條約也無法防止恐怖行動
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.97,0:07:19.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.40,0:07:26.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布的公主已經抵達
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.54,0:07:32.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀呀 真忙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.26,0:07:37.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,穿這身合適嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.67,0:07:40.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,應該有帶晚禮服吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.56,0:07:44.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,都一樣 這樣有什麼不可以
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.99,0:07:49.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,有時也需要作些演出
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.58,0:07:51.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你也應該明白
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.37,0:07:56.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,當然不用太鄭重其事 但也別讓人小看了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.78,0:07:59.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這次雖然是非公開訪問
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.88,0:08:02.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你現在畢竟是奧布的國家元首
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.17,0:08:05.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸 船在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.67,0:08:07.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是軍艦嗎 空母？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.93,0:08:09.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,看來還是有必要
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.81,0:08:12.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓那些自然人們看看
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.77,0:08:28.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明天是戰後首次的新型戰艦下水儀式吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.82,0:08:32.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明知道我們這次來的目的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.41,0:08:35.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,安排這種時候這種地點
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.26,0:08:36.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,實在擔待不起
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.93,0:08:42.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是我方提出秘密且緊急進行會談 阿斯哈代表
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.54,0:08:50.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,狄蘭達爾議長認為這樣比直接去Plant更能掩人耳目
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.85,0:09:14.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這不是公主嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.38,0:09:17.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,勞駕你千里迢迢前來非常抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.34,0:09:23.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 議長能在百忙之中抽出時間
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.54,0:09:24.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,甚感榮幸
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.60,0:09:32.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,貴國情況可好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.03,0:09:38.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,自從公主上臺後解決了許多難題
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.00,0:09:41.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我作為盟友也非常高興
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.53,0:09:44.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,甚至有點羡慕
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.94,0:09:46.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還都百廢待興
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.65,0:09:51.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼 這種情勢下首相如此秘密地
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.54,0:09:56.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而且又如此急切的想見我 到底是為何
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.68,0:09:59.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,據我們大使所說
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.51,0:10:04.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是為一件非常複雜的議案而來
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.75,0:10:08.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我倒不認為複雜
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.86,0:10:14.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但至今未能收到貴國明確的答復
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.34,0:10:18.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,看來的確很複雜的問題
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.88,0:10:25.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,希望立即停止利用我國戰爭期間流失的技術人員
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.74,0:10:29.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為貴國的軍事工業服務
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.93,0:10:48.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是在幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.89,0:10:52.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,某個得意忘形的傻瓜在演出吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.43,0:10:56.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你也去傻一回吧 陪她
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.26,0:11:06.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為何至今仍無任何反應
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.50,0:11:22.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.23,0:11:23.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,誰？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.71,0:11:34.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,抓到胸了吧 我說你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.96,0:11:38.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這個死色鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.42,0:11:40.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.39,0:11:44.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,約翰
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.25,0:11:59.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,公主是在上次戰爭中親自駕駛MS參加戰鬥的勇士
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.44,0:12:07.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,又是不屈服於外界壓力將自己理念貫徹到底的奧布之獅
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.43,0:12:09.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,烏滋米大人的繼承者
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.19,0:12:19.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那應該明白現在的世界局勢下我們該如何自處
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.68,0:12:24.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們會貫徹本國的理念 僅此而已
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.86,0:12:29.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不侵略他國 也不允許他國的侵略
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.09,0:12:32.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不介入他國的紛爭？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.05,0:12:33.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.74,0:12:37.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也是同樣
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.21,0:12:39.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,能這樣當然最好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.97,0:12:43.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但沒有力量則無法實現
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.02,0:12:46.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這點對於公主 不...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.25,0:12:49.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,公主應該更清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.26,0:12:54.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布不也軍備齊整嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.82,0:12:59.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,能否停止公主這個稱呼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.38,0:13:01.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是我失禮了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.48,0:13:03.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯哈代表
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.74,0:13:11.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那您又為何害怕呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.96,0:13:14.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是大西洋聯邦的壓力嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.77,0:13:19.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他們認為奧布在為我們提供違反條約的軍事資助？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.50,0:13:24.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但這種事當然是無中生有
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.58,0:13:33.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們的確曾經熱情接待了奧布防衛戰中流離失所的難民
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.81,0:13:42.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他們為在這裏生活下去而發揮自己的技術也無可厚非
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.41,0:14:11.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但過強的力量又會招來爭端
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.32,0:14:27.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧盧 上面
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.10,0:14:30.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 公主
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.11,0:14:34.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為爭端無法消除所以才需要力量
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.29,0:14:42.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,希丁克
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.62,0:14:44.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.32,0:14:58.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.02,0:15:00.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,OK 情報沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.87,0:15:01.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可以
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.20,0:15:03.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,量子反應開始
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.76,0:15:04.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,緩衝裝置良好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.20,0:15:08.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,裝備測試 全部正常
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.45,0:15:10.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,系統以戰鬥狀態啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.37,0:15:48.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,警報？ 怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.04,0:15:49.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,六號機庫
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.24,0:15:50.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.40,0:15:57.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.91,0:15:58.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.27,0:15:58.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.00,0:16:08.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Chaos Gaia Abyss
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.23,0:16:10.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,先打爛機庫
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.01,0:16:12.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,MS會從那裏出來
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.93,0:16:14.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉 你負責左邊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.74,0:16:15.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.18,0:16:28.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,趕緊搭乘
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.81,0:16:30.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是六號機庫的新型機
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.91,0:16:32.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不知被誰搶了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.91,0:16:35.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,出動MS奪回
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.58,0:16:36.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說什麼
